 to Sara Hotchkiss, May 9, 1862"," ",["$","$Ld",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$27:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":12}]]}]}],["$","li","https://www.loc.gov/item/2005625009/",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.loc.gov/item/2005625009/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Library of Congress: Hotchkiss sketch of the Battle of McDowell"," ",["$","$Ld",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$27:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":12}]]}]}],["$","li","https://encyclopediavirginia.org/entries/mcdowell-battle-of/",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://encyclopediavirginia.org/entries/mcdowell-battle-of/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Encyclopedia Virginia: Battle of McDowell"," ",["$","$Ld",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$27:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":12}]]}]}],["$","li","https://www.shenandoahatwar.org/mcdowell-article",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.shenandoahatwar.org/mcdowell-article","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Shenandoah Valley Battlefields Foundation: Battle of McDowell"," ",["$","$Ld",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$27:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":12}]]}]}],"$L53","$L54","$L55","$L56","$L57","$L58","$L59"]}]]}]
